@startuml
title G1 单轮大循环：Young-only 与 Space-Reclamation
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor white
hide empty description
state "Normal Young GC\n(仅年轻代疏散, STW)" as NY
state "Concurrent Start\n(Young GC + 初始标记, STW)" as CS
state "Concurrent Mark\n(并发标记, 含根区扫描)" as CM
state "Remark\n(STW, 排空 SATB 收尾)" as RE
state "Cleanup\n(STW + 并发, 统计/选候选)" as CL
state "Prepare Mixed\n(一次 Young GC)" as PM
state "Mixed GC\n(年轻代 + 部分老年代, STW)" as MG
state "Full GC\n(并行 mark-compact 回退)" as FG
[*] --> NY
NY --> NY : 继续晋升
NY --> CS : 老年代占用达到 IHOP 阈值
CS --> CM : 初始标记完成
CM --> RE : 并发标记完成
RE --> CL : 标记终结
CL --> PM : 存在值得回收的候选
CL --> NY : 垃圾不足(收益 < G1HeapWastePercent)
PM --> MG : 下一次即可混合收集
MG --> MG : 候选未取完且收益仍达标
MG --> NY : 空间回收阶段结束
NY --> FG : 疏散失败 / 分配失败
MG --> FG : 疏散失败
FG --> NY : 全堆整理完成
note right of FG
  正常路径应尽量避免 Full GC；
  它是所有回退路径的兜底。
end note
@enduml
